,"gloss":"East (Gate)","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":74},{"base":"H1568","lemma":"גִּלְעָד","tr":"gil·ad","gloss":"Gilead","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":134},{"base":"H3427","lemma":"יָשַׁב","tr":"ya·shav","gloss":"to dwell","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":1079}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"MAT","chapter":2,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"‘But you, Bethlehem, in the land of Judah, are by no means least among the rulers of Judah, for out of you will come a ruler who will be the shepherd of My people Israel.’”","from":2},{"book":"GEN","chapter":35,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"While Israel was living in that region, Reuben went in and slept with his fatherʼs concubine Bilhah, and Israel heard about it. Jacob had twelve sons:","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"The sons of Reuben: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi.","from":3},{"book":"MIC","chapter":5,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"But you, Bethlehem Ephrathah, who are small among the clans of Judah, out of you will come forth for Me One to be ruler over Israel— One whose origins are of old, from the days of eternity.","from":2},{"book":"GEN","chapter":29,"verse":32,"verseEnd":32,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"And Leah conceived and gave birth to a son, and she named him Reuben, for she said, “The Lordhas seen my affliction. Surely my husband will love me now.”","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":48,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"Then he blessed Joseph and said: “May the God before whom my fathers Abraham and Isaac walked, the God who has been my shepherd all my life to this day,","from":1},{"book":"GEN","chapter":48,"verse":22,"verseEnd":22,"votes":6,"source":"openbible","text":"And to you, as one who is above your brothers, I give the ridge of land that I took from the Amorites with my sword and bow.”","from":1},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"These were the heads of their fathersʼ houses: The sons of Reuben, the firstborn of Israel, were Hanoch and Pallu, Hezron and Carmi. These were the clans of Reuben.","from":3}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":4}]},"11-17":{"people":[{"id":"gad-h1410g","name":"Gad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"janai-h3285","name":"Janai","kind":"person","brief":"Gad leader","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"joel-h3100k","name":"Joel","kind":"person","brief":"From Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"shapham-h8223","name":"Shapham","kind":"person","brief":"From Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"shaphat-h8202j","name":"Shaphat","kind":"person","brief":"From Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"eber-h5677h","name":"Eber","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abihail","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"jacan-h3275","name":"Jacan","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abihail","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"jorai-h3140","name":"Jorai","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abihail","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"meshullam-h4918i","name":"Meshullam","kind":"person","brief":"Gadite leader","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"michael-h4317h","name":"Michael","kind":"person","brief":"Gadite leader","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"sheba-h7652g","name":"Sheba","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abihail","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"zia-h2127","name":"Zia","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abihail","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"abihail-h0032i","name":"Abihail","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Huri","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"buz-h0938h","name":"Buz","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Jahdo","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"gilead-h1568j","name":"Gilead","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Michael","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"huri-h2359","name":"Huri","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Jaroah","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"jahdo-h